  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "all-recipes-xs",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tall-recipes-xs (500)\n\t\n\nAll Recipes dataset (extra small).\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\n# Load the dataset\ndataset = load_dataset(\"AWeirdDev/all-recipes-xs\")\n\nAlternatively, load with pickle from _frozen.pkl:\nimport pickle\nimport requests\n\nr = requests.get(\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/AWeirdDev/all-recipes-xs/resolve/main/_frozen.pkl\")\ndataset = pickle.loads(r.content)\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tFeatures\n\t\n\nNote: Empty values are presented as \"unknown\" instead of None (normally, unless\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AWeirdDev/all-recipes-xs.",
  "alternateName": [
    "AWeirdDev/all-recipes-xs",
    "All Recipes (xs)"
  ],
